OL,3,AUS and Denmark reach deal over
OL,4,AGreenland after Trump annexation
OL,5,Athreats
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe leaders of Denmark and Greenland
OL,8,Fwelcomed the deal to "strengthen
OL,9,Fsecurity", which they said was expected
OL,10,Fto be signed next week, but did not
OL,11,Foutline its contents.
OL,13,FThe deal comes after months of threats
OL,14,Fby Trump to "take" Greenland over
OL,15,Fnational security concerns, citing its
OL,16,Fstrategic location for defence purposes
OL,17,Fand its mineral wealth.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
